OL,3,GNEWSAItems stolen from Man Utd Munich
OL,4,Aair disaster memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manchester Munich Memorial
OL,7,FFoundation (MMMF) says it was "deeply
OL,8,Fsaddened" after items commemmorating
OL,9,Fthe victims were stolen from a memorial
OL,10,Fin Germany.
OL,12,FGerman newspaper Hallo Munchen said the
OL,13,Fitems were taken from a glass display
OL,14,Fcase at Manchesterplatz in Munich on
OL,15,FMonday, 26 October.
OL,17,FMunich Police told local reporters the
OL,18,Fcase had been smashed with a stone and
OL,19,Fsaid the incident was believed to have
OL,20,Fhappened between 08:00 and 13:00 local
OL,21,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
